    "poang": "(4/0/0)",
    "t": "<p>En metallkub har sidan 5,0 cm och massan 1,05 kg.</p><span class=\"fig\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"480\" height=\"301\" viewBox=\"0 0 550 345\" style=\"display:block;width:480px;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:301px;margin:12px auto\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Rätblock med mått utanför respektive kant\"><title>Rätblock med mått utanför respektive kant</title><path d=\"M70,133 l65,-55 h150 l-65,55 Z\" fill=\"#e4edf3\" stroke=\"#293747\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><rect x=\"70\" y=\"133\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#f9fbfc\" stroke=\"#293747\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/><path d=\"M220,133 l65,-55 v150 l-65,55 Z\" fill=\"#cbdde8\" stroke=\"#293747\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"287\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"313\" stroke=\"#8494a0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"220\" y1=\"287\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"313\" stroke=\"#8494a0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"308\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"308\" stroke=\"#8494a0\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"304\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"312\" stroke=\"#8494a0\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><line x1=\"220\" y1=\"304\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"312\" stroke=\"#8494a0\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"145\" y=\"331\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#293747\">5,0 cm</text><line x1=\"222.5837689658647\" y1=\"286.05354514147643\" x2=\"242.6079784513161\" y2=\"309.718519987919\" stroke=\"#8494a0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"287.5837689658647\" y1=\"231.05354514147646\" x2=\"307.60797845131606\" y2=\"254.718519987919\" stroke=\"#8494a0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"239.37826724398522\" y1=\"305.9015885610734\" x2=\"304.3782672439852\" y2=\"250.90158856107342\" stroke=\"#8494a0\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><line x1=\"236.79449827812053\" y1=\"302.848043419597\" x2=\"241.9620362098499\" y2=\"308.95513370254986\" stroke=\"#8494a0\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><line x1=\"301.7944982781205\" y1=\"247.84804341959696\" x2=\"306.9620362098499\" y2=\"253.9551337025499\" stroke=\"#8494a0\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"283.5052275903763\" y=\"297.1425416977175\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#293747\">5,0 cm</text><line x1=\"289\" y1=\"228\" x2=\"335\" y2=\"228\" stroke=\"#8494a0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"289\" y1=\"78\" x2=\"335\" y2=\"78\" stroke=\"#8494a0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"330\" y1=\"228\" x2=\"330\" y2=\"78\" stroke=\"#8494a0\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><line x1=\"326\" y1=\"228\" x2=\"334\" y2=\"228\" stroke=\"#8494a0\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><line x1=\"326\" y1=\"78\" x2=\"334\" y2=\"78\" stroke=\"#8494a0\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"342\" y=\"158\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#293747\">5,0 cm</text><text x=\"205\" y=\"32\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#293747\">m = 1,05 kg</text></svg></span><ol><li>Bestäm volymen i cm³.</li><li>Ange massan i g.</li><li>Bestäm densiteten i g/cm³.</li><li>Bestäm densiteten i kg/m³.</li></ol><p>Använd de givna talen och avrunda inte.</p>",
    "s": "<p>a) Volymen är 5³ = 125 cm³.</p><p>b) 1,05 kg = 1050 g.</p><p>c) Volymen är 125 cm³. Densiteten är 1050/125 = 8,40 g/cm³.</p><p>d) 1050/125 = 8,40 g/cm³ = 8400 kg/m³.</p>",
