        "t": "<p>En person står mellan två klippväggar och klappar i händerna. De två ekona är direkta reflexer från var sin vägg. Det första ekot hörs efter 0,40 sekunder och det andra efter 1,10 sekunder. Ljudets fart är 340 m/s.</p><span class=\"fig\"><svg height=\"308\" width=\"620\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewBox=\"0.000 25.714 492.143 244.286\"><rect x=\"20\" y=\"200\" width=\"450\" height=\"8\" fill=\"#E8DCC6\"/><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"470\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><rect x=\"20\" y=\"40\" width=\"34\" height=\"160\" fill=\"#E8DCC6\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"436\" y=\"40\" width=\"34\" height=\"160\" fill=\"#E8DCC6\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"173.7\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"176.6\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"186.3\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"176.6\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"180\" y1=\"176.6\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"156.8\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"3.24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"180\" y1=\"162.2\" x2=\"194.4\" y2=\"158.6\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2.3400000000000003\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"148.7\" r=\"8.1\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"196\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"290\" y2=\"130\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"300.00,130.00 290.00,134.60 290.00,125.40\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\"/><line x1=\"164\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"72\" y2=\"160\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"62.00,160.00 72.00,155.40 72.00,164.60\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\"/><text x=\"250\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\">ljud åt höger</text><text x=\"112\" y=\"178\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\">ljud åt vänster</text><line x1=\"54\" y1=\"226\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"226\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"54\" y1=\"221\" x2=\"54\" y2=\"231\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"180\" y1=\"221\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"231\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><text x=\"117\" y=\"242\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#5C575E\">d₁</text><line x1=\"180\" y1=\"250\" x2=\"436\" y2=\"250\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"180\" y1=\"245\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"255\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"436\" y1=\"245\" x2=\"436\" y2=\"255\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><text x=\"308\" y=\"266\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#5C575E\">d₂</text></svg></span><p>Bestäm avståndet mellan väggarna i m.</p>",
        "s": "<p>Personen står mellan väggarna: 68 + 187 = 255 m.</p>",
        "ledtrad": "<p>Vilken väg färdas ljudet innan ett eko når personen?</p>",
