    "typ": "beräkna resulterande fart med och mot strömmen och därav tiderna, ur diagram, sökt hastighet och tid",
    "poang": "(4/0/0)",
    "t": "<p>En kanotist paddlar med farten 1,8 m/s i stilla vatten. I älven är strömhastigheten 0,7 m/s.</p><span class=\"fig\"><svg height=\"183\" width=\"620\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewBox=\"0.000 50.714 500.000 147.857\"><rect x=\"15\" y=\"60\" width=\"470\" height=\"110\" fill=\"#DCE6F2\"/><line x1=\"15\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"485\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"15\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"485\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"148\" x2=\"96\" y2=\"148\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"106.00,148.00 96.00,152.60 96.00,143.40\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\"/><line x1=\"180\" y1=\"148\" x2=\"216\" y2=\"148\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"226.00,148.00 216.00,152.60 216.00,143.40\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\"/><line x1=\"300\" y1=\"148\" x2=\"336\" y2=\"148\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"346.00,148.00 336.00,152.60 336.00,143.40\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\"/><line x1=\"400\" y1=\"148\" x2=\"436\" y2=\"148\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"446.00,148.00 436.00,152.60 436.00,143.40\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\"/><text x=\"250\" y=\"190\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\">strömmen 0,7 m/s</text><path d=\"M 170 120 L 330 120 L 306 98 L 194 98 Z\" fill=\"#DCEAF6\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"250\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2B2527\">kanot</text></svg></span><ol><li>Bestäm farten relativt stranden medströms, i m/s.</li><li>Bestäm farten relativt stranden motströms, i m/s.</li><li>Hur lång tid tar 500 m medströms? Svara i s.</li><li>Hur lång tid tar 500 m motströms? Avrunda till hela s.</li></ol>",
    "s": "<p>a) 1,8 + 0,7 = 2,5 m/s.</p><p>b) 1,8 − 0,7 = 1,1 m/s, riktad mot strömmen.</p><p>c) 500/2,5 = 200 s.</p><p>d) 500/1,1 ≈ 455 s.</p>",
