        "t": "<p>En löpare accelererar likformigt upp till 9 m/s och håller sedan den farten resten av loppet på 100 m.</p><span class=\"fig\"><svg height=\"176\" width=\"620\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewBox=\"0.000 18.443 430.000 121.721\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"92\" width=\"410\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#ECEFF3\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"92\" x2=\"420\" y2=\"92\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><circle cx=\"88\" cy=\"34\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#ECEFF3\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"86\" y1=\"42\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"66\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polyline points=\"83,49 96,46 100,56\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polyline points=\"83,49 70,52 64,43\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polyline points=\"76,66 92,74 88,86\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polyline points=\"76,66 66,80 58,92\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><line x1=\"130\" y1=\"73\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"73\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><polygon points=\"200,73 190,77.6 190,68.4\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\"/><text x=\"215\" y=\"77\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\">v = 9 m/s</text><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"128\" x2=\"410\" y2=\"128\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"123\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"133\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"410\" y1=\"123\" x2=\"410\" y2=\"133\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><text x=\"225\" y=\"119\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#5C575E\">100 m</text></svg></span><p>Löparen startar från vila vid t = 0. Accelerationen 1,8 m/s² gäller fram till farten 9 m/s.</p><p>Bestäm accelerationsfasens tid i s.</p>",
        "s": "<p>t = 9/1,8 = 5 s.</p>",
        "ledtrad": "<p>Skilj accelerationsfasen från återstående sträcka med konstant fart.</p>",
        "niva": "E",
