    "t": "<p>Ett föremåls hastighet visas i diagrammet.</p><span class=\"fig\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"470\" height=\"270\" viewBox=\"0 0 470 270\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Hastighet–tid-diagram\"><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"white\"/><line x1=\"45\" y1=\"225.0\" x2=\"425\" y2=\"225.0\" stroke=\"#374151\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><line x1=\"45.0\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"45.0\" y2=\"225\" stroke=\"#374151\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><polyline points=\"45.0,96.4 213.9,96.4 425.0,45.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#176b87\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"425\" y=\"258\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"Arial\">t (s)</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"33\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"Arial\">v (m/s)</text><text x=\"213.9\" y=\"243.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\">4</text><text x=\"425.0\" y=\"243.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\">9</text><text x=\"37.0\" y=\"100.4\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\">5</text><text x=\"37.0\" y=\"49.0\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\">7</text></svg></span><p>Vid t = 9 s är läget x = 80 m. Bestäm startläget x(0) i m.</p>",
    "s": "<p>Förflyttningen är arean: 5 · 4 + (5 + 7)/2 · 5 = 50 m. Eftersom x(9) = x(0) + 50 m blir startläget 80 − 50 = 30 m.</p>",
