    "id": "3.166",
    "kap": 3,
    "omr": "konstacc",
    "niva": "C",
    "typ": "bestamma retardation och begynnelsefart ur strackorna under tva olika sekunder av en inbromsning, ur text, sokt acceleration och fart",
    "poang": "(0/2/0)",
    "t": "<p>En bil bromsar med konstant acceleration och rör sig framåt under de första fyra sekunderna. Under första sekunden kör den 22 m och under fjärde sekunden 10 m.</p><span class=\"fig\"><svg height=\"142\" width=\"620\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewBox=\"0.000 65.018 470.000 107.917\"><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"96\" x2=\"454\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"106\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#5C575E\">0 s</text><line x1=\"155.28\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"155.28\" y2=\"106\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><text x=\"155.28\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#5C575E\">1,0 s</text><line x1=\"257.78\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"257.78\" y2=\"106\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><text x=\"257.78\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#5C575E\">2,0 s</text><line x1=\"337.5\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"337.5\" y2=\"106\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><text x=\"337.5\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#5C575E\">3,0 s</text><line x1=\"394.44\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"394.44\" y2=\"106\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><text x=\"394.44\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#5C575E\">4,0 s</text><line x1=\"32\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"153.28\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\"/><polygon points=\"32,120 39,123 39,117\" fill=\"#5C575E\"/><polygon points=\"153.28,120 146.28,123 146.28,117\" fill=\"#5C575E\"/><text x=\"92.64\" y=\"136\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#5C575E\">22 m</text><line x1=\"339.5\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"392.44\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\"/><polygon points=\"339.5,120 346.5,123 346.5,117\" fill=\"#5C575E\"/><polygon points=\"392.44,120 385.44,123 385.44,117\" fill=\"#5C575E\"/><text x=\"365.97\" y=\"136\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#5C575E\">10 m</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"164\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#5C575E\">likformig inbromsning</text></svg></span><ol><li>Bestäm retardationens storlek. Svara i m/s².</li><li>Bestäm startfarten. Svara i m/s.</li></ol>",
    "s": "<p>a) Sträckorna under lika långa sekundintervall motsvarar medelfarterna. Skillnaden −12 m/s uppstår på 3 s: a = −12/3 = −4 m/s². Svaret är 4 m/s².</p><p>b) Under första sekunden är medelfarten v₀ + a/2 = 22. Med a = (10 − 22)/3 = −4 m/s² fås v₀ = 24 m/s. Svaret är 24 m/s.</p>",
