    "t": "<p>En kitesurfare med bräda har massan 78 kg. Draken drar med 500 N i vinkeln 35° över vattenytan, och vattnets vågräta bromskraft är 220 N. Ingen lodrät acceleration sker. Använd g = 9,82 m/s².</p><span class=\"fig\"><svg height=\"293\" width=\"620\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewBox=\"0 0 500 236\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"170\" width=\"500\" height=\"66\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#DCE6F2\" stroke=\"none\"/><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"500\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><path d=\"M 36 186 q 9 -6 18 0 q 9 6 18 0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M 118 186 q 9 -6 18 0 q 9 6 18 0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M 366 186 q 9 -6 18 0 q 9 6 18 0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M 440 186 q 9 -6 18 0 q 9 6 18 0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"136,176 244,176 252,164 128,164\" fill=\"#DCEAF6\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><line x1=\"176\" y1=\"164\" x2=\"188\" y2=\"136\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"206\" y1=\"164\" x2=\"192\" y2=\"136\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"168\" y1=\"162\" x2=\"182\" y2=\"162\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"200\" y1=\"162\" x2=\"214\" y2=\"162\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"190\" y1=\"136\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"104\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"3.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"190\" cy=\"94\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"190\" y1=\"116\" x2=\"224\" y2=\"104\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"224\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"330\" y2=\"104\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/><line x1=\"224\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"324.81\" y2=\"33.34\" stroke=\"#B43123\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"333,27.6 327.45,37.11 322.17,29.57\" fill=\"#B43123\"/><text x=\"256\" y=\"50\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#B43123\">500 N</text><path d=\"M 336 16 q 44 4 56 34 q -38 16 -66 6 z\" fill=\"#DCEAF6\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M 270 104 A 46 46 0 0 0 261.68 77.62\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"281.22\" y=\"89.96\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#5C575E\">35°</text><line x1=\"134\" y1=\"168\" x2=\"88.5\" y2=\"168\" stroke=\"#B43123\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\"/><polygon points=\"78,168 88.5,163.2 88.5,172.8\" fill=\"#B43123\"/><text x=\"66\" y=\"180\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#B43123\">220 N</text><text x=\"190\" y=\"212\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#5C575E\">m = 78 kg</text></svg></span><ol><li>Bestäm dragkraftens vågräta komponent. Svara i N. Avrunda vid behov till två decimaler.</li><li>Bestäm dragkraftens lodräta komponent. Svara i N. Avrunda vid behov till två decimaler.</li><li>Bestäm accelerationen framåt. Svara i m/s². Avrunda vid behov till två decimaler.</li><li>Bestäm vattnets sammanlagda stödjande kraft uppåt. Svara i N. Avrunda vid behov till två decimaler.</li></ol>",
    "s": "<p>a) F_x = 500 cos 35°. Svaret är 409,58 N.</p><p>b) F_y = 500 sin 35°. Svaret är 286,79 N.</p><p>c) a = (500 cos 35° − 220)/78. Svaret är 2,43 m/s².</p><p>d) Lodrät balans: N + 500 sin 35° − 78 · 9,82 = 0. Draken bär en del av tyngden. Svaret är 479,17 N.</p>",
