"square\"/><line x1=\"260\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"268\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"278\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"280\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"288\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"290\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"298\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><polyline points=\"200,44 211,46.4615 189,51.3846 211,56.3077 189,61.2308 211,66.1538 189,71.0769 211,76 189,80.9231 211,85.8462 189,90.7692 211,95.6923 189,100.615 200,108\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><line x1=\"200\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"44\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"200\" y1=\"108\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"122\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><rect x=\"172\" y=\"122\" width=\"56\" height=\"34\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#ECEFF3\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"143\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2B2527\">500 g</text><line x1=\"300\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"122\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"295\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"305\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"295\" y1=\"122\" x2=\"305\" y2=\"122\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><text x=\"308\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#5C575E\">l = 26 cm</text><line x1=\"115\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"115\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"110\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"110\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><text x=\"107\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#5C575E\">l₀ = 20 cm</text></svg></span><p>Bestäm hela längden med en stilla massa på 1,2 kg i stället. Svara i cm. Avrunda vid behov till två decimaler.</p>",
        "s": "<p>Förlängningen blir 6 · (1,2/0,50) = 14,4 cm. Lägg till obelastade 20 cm: längden är 34,4 cm. Svaret är 34,4 cm.</p>",
        "ledtrad": "<p>Skala först förlängningen med massförhållandet. Lägg sedan till obelastad längd.</p>",
