        "t": "<p>En kundvagn på 24 kg skjuts från vila med konstant vågrät kraft 36 N på ett vågrätt underlag. Motståndet försummas. Använd F_res = ma.</p><span class=\"fig\"><svg height=\"230\" width=\"620\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewBox=\"1.714 9.439 286.286 105.974\"><rect x=\"15\" y=\"102\" width=\"260\" height=\"8\" fill=\"#E8DCC6\"/><line x1=\"15\" y1=\"102\" x2=\"275\" y2=\"102\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><rect x=\"90\" y=\"44\" width=\"110\" height=\"42\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#E8DCC6\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"145\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#2B2527\">24 kg</text><circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"94\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"94\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"90\" y1=\"52\" x2=\"68\" y2=\"32\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"68\" y1=\"32\" x2=\"56\" y2=\"32\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"24\" y1=\"32\" x2=\"44\" y2=\"32\" stroke=\"#B43123\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"52,32 43,27.6 43,36.4\" fill=\"#B43123\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"23\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#B43123\">F</text></svg></span><p>Bestäm accelerationen. Svara i m/s². Avrunda vid behov till två decimaler.</p>",
