    "id": "5.15",
    "kap": 5,
    "omr": "rorelsemangd",
    "niva": "E",
    "poang": "(2/0/0)",
    "t": "<p>Den bakre vagnen på 2,5 kg rör sig åt höger med 4,0 m/s. Den främre på 4,0 kg rör sig åt höger med 1,8 m/s. De fastnar när den bakre kör ikapp. Försumma yttre horisontell impuls. Höger är positiv riktning.</p><span class=\"fig\"><svg height=\"305\" width=\"500\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewBox=\"0.000 5.659 335.029 204.341\"><text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#5C575E\">Före</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"56\" width=\"76\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"68.24\" cy=\"96\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"68.24\" cy=\"96\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><circle cx=\"107.76\" cy=\"96\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"107.76\" cy=\"96\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><text x=\"88\" y=\"77\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2B2527\">2,5 kg</text><line x1=\"64\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"102\" y2=\"36\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\"/><polygon points=\"112,36 102,40.6 102,31.4\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\"/><text x=\"88\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\">4,0 m/s</text><rect x=\"244\" y=\"56\" width=\"76\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"262.24\" cy=\"96\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"262.24\" cy=\"96\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><circle cx=\"301.76\" cy=\"96\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"301.76\" cy=\"96\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><text x=\"282\" y=\"77\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2B2527\">4,0 kg</text><line x1=\"258\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"296\" y2=\"36\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\"/><polygon points=\"306,36 296,40.6 296,31.4\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\"/><text x=\"282\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\">1,8 m/s</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"178\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#5C575E\">Efter</text><rect x=\"122\" y=\"156\" width=\"76\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"140.24\" cy=\"196\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"140.24\" cy=\"196\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><circle cx=\"179.76\" cy=\"196\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"179.76\" cy=\"196\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"177\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2B2527\">2,5 kg</text><rect x=\"202\" y=\"156\" width=\"76\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"220.24\" cy=\"196\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"220.24\" cy=\"196\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><circle cx=\"259.76\" cy=\"196\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"259.76\" cy=\"196\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><text x=\"240\" y=\"177\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2B2527\">4,0 kg</text><line x1=\"216\" y1=\"136\" x2=\"254\" y2=\"136\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\"/><polygon points=\"264,136 254,140.6 254,131.4\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\"/><text x=\"240\" y=\"124\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\">v = ?</text></svg></span><p>Bestäm deras gemensamma hastighet efter stöten. Svara i m/s. Avrunda vid behov till 2 decimaler.</p>",
    "s": "<p>p_före = 2,5 · 4,0+4,0 · 1,8 = 17,2 kg·m/s. (2,5+4,0)v = 17,2 ger v ≈ +2,64615 m/s. Svaret ligger mellan de ursprungliga hastigheterna. Svar: 2,65 m/s.</p>",
