    "spelIntro": "<p>En vagn på 1,5 kg rör sig åt höger med 0,90 m/s mot en vagn på 4,0 kg som rör sig åt vänster med 0,40 m/s. De fastnar i varandra. Försumma yttre horisontell impuls. Höger är positiv riktning.</p><span class=\"fig\"><svg height=\"287\" width=\"500\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewBox=\"0.000 5.659 356.400 204.341\"><text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#5C575E\">Före</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"56\" width=\"76\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"78.24\" cy=\"96\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"78.24\" cy=\"96\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><circle cx=\"117.76\" cy=\"96\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"117.76\" cy=\"96\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><text x=\"98\" y=\"77\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2B2527\">1,5 kg</text><line x1=\"74\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"112\" y2=\"36\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\"/><polygon points=\"122,36 112,40.6 112,31.4\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\"/><text x=\"98\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\">0,90 m/s</text><rect x=\"264\" y=\"56\" width=\"76\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"282.24\" cy=\"96\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"282.24\" cy=\"96\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><circle cx=\"321.76\" cy=\"96\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"321.76\" cy=\"96\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><text x=\"302\" y=\"77\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2B2527\">4,0 kg</text><line x1=\"326\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"288\" y2=\"36\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\"/><polygon points=\"278,36 288,31.4 288,40.6\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\"/><text x=\"302\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\">0,40 m/s</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"178\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#5C575E\">Efter</text><rect x=\"122\" y=\"156\" width=\"76\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"140.24\" cy=\"196\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"140.24\" cy=\"196\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><circle cx=\"179.76\" cy=\"196\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"179.76\" cy=\"196\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"177\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2B2527\">1,5 kg</text><rect x=\"202\" y=\"156\" width=\"76\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"220.24\" cy=\"196\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"220.24\" cy=\"196\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><circle cx=\"259.76\" cy=\"196\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"259.76\" cy=\"196\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><text x=\"240\" y=\"177\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2B2527\">4,0 kg</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"124\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\">v = ?</text></svg></span>",
