    "id": "5.86",
    "kap": 5,
    "omr": "rorelsemangd",
    "niva": "E",
    "poang": "(2/0/0)",
    "t": "<p>En vagn på 1,5 kg har hastigheten +4,0 m/s före en stöt och −1,0 m/s efteråt. Den andra vagnen på 2,5 kg har före stöten hastigheten −2,0 m/s. Höger är positiv riktning. Försumma yttre horisontell impuls.</p><span class=\"fig\"><svg height=\"302\" width=\"500\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewBox=\"0.000 0.000 341.543 206.000\"><text x=\"12\" y=\"72\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#5C575E\">Före</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"50\" width=\"76\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"78\" cy=\"90\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"78\" cy=\"90\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><circle cx=\"118\" cy=\"90\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"118\" cy=\"90\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><line x1=\"74\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"112\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><polygon points=\"122,30 112,34.6 112,25.4\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\"/><text x=\"98\" y=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\">4,0 m/s</text><rect x=\"250\" y=\"50\" width=\"76\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"268\" cy=\"90\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"268\" cy=\"90\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><circle cx=\"308\" cy=\"90\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"308\" cy=\"90\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><line x1=\"312\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"274\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><polygon points=\"264,30 274,25.4 274,34.6\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\"/><text x=\"288\" y=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\">2,0 m/s</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"172\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#5C575E\">Efter</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"150\" width=\"76\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"78\" cy=\"190\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"78\" cy=\"190\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><circle cx=\"118\" cy=\"190\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"118\" cy=\"190\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><line x1=\"122\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"84\" y2=\"130\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><polygon points=\"74,130 84,125.4 84,134.6\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\"/><text x=\"98\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\">1,0 m/s</text><rect x=\"250\" y=\"150\" width=\"76\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"268\" cy=\"190\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"268\" cy=\"190\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><circle cx=\"308\" cy=\"190\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"308\" cy=\"190\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><text x=\"288\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\">v = ?</text></svg></span><ol style=\"display:grid;gap:0.85rem\"><li>Bestäm total rörelsemängd före stöten. Svara i kg·m/s. Avrunda vid behov till 2 decimaler.</li><li>Bestäm den tyngre vagnens hastighet efteråt. Svara i m/s. Avrunda vid behov till 2 decimaler.</li></ol>",
    "s": "<p>a) p_före = 1,5 · 4,0+2,5 · (−2,0) = +1,0 kg·m/s. Svar: 1 kg·m/s.</p><p>b) 1,5 · 4,0−2,5 · 2,0 = 1,5 · (−1,0)+2,5v. Alltså 1,0 = −1,5+2,5v och v = +1,0 m/s. Svar: 1 m/s.</p>",
