        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Den nominella energin är</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[E=QU=7200\\cdot9{,}0=64800\\ \\mathrm J=64{,}8\\ \\mathrm{kJ}\\]</div></div></div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(64{,}8\\ \\mathrm{kJ}\\).</p></div>",
        "ledtrad": "<p>Välj den effektform som passar givna storheter: \\(P=UI=I^2R=U^2/R\\). Energin under tiden \\(t\\) är \\(E=Pt\\).</p>",
        "niva": "C",
        "poang": "0/1/0"
