        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Totalresistansen är 600 Ω.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[I=\\frac{12}{600}\\approx0{,}02\\ \\mathrm{A}=20\\ \\mathrm{mA}\\]</div></div></div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(20\\ \\mathrm{mA}\\).</p></div>",
